N5008 [locale.general]/8, [facet.numpunct.virtuals]: the "C"-locale
num_put<char> and numpunct<char> data live in libstdc++.so; the front end
models them (cpp_typecheck_stdlib.cpp classic_num_put and
classic_numpunct_cache).
